   "x": 855,
   "w": 449,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "A better ending, for most."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 247,
   "x": 136,
   "w": 580,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Affect ratings rise as conversations unfold. Partners grow closer in how they feel, but don’t always see the encounter the same way."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 262,
   "x": 855,
   "w": 449,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "End-of-conversation affect exceeds pre-conversation affect in 69.2% of complete records. Yet a shared conversation can still produce two different experiences."
  },
